SYSTEM a certificate import, told what the uploads really are
REPORTS message
RUNS import

PLACE pdf ONE OUTSIDE
    SAYS a PDF of one or more certificates, from the business system, edited by hand, or from another system
PLACE register MANY LASTING
    SAYS one record for each certificate number
PLACE files MANY LASTING
    SAYS the library of PDFs, one file for each certificate number
PLACE message ONE REPORT

FAULT the pdf cannot be read ABOUT pdf
FAULT a page has no number ABOUT pdf
FAULT the pdf is a scan with no text ABOUT pdf
FAULT a field was edited by hand into a form the import does not read ABOUT pdf
FAULT the pdf comes from another system ABOUT pdf
FAULT the number on the pdf is not this certificate's ABOUT pdf
    SAYS a wrong number: one allocated to another certificate, or one never used

SEQ import
    split it
    record it

ACTION split it
    READS pdf
    CREATE files MANY FROM pdf
        LATER STANDS
        BECAUSE the file is the certificate as it was uploaded
    REFUSE
        WHEN ANY
            the pdf cannot be read
            a page has no number
            the pdf is a scan with no text
            files already has the member
    ACCEPT WHEN files is given a key twice
        BECAUSE pages that reuse a number one after another are one certificate

ACTION record it
    READS pdf
    CREATE register MANY FROM pdf
    REFUSE WHEN register already has the member
        SAYS the number is already in the register, so the upload is held for review
    ACCEPT WHEN register is given a key twice
        BECAUSE the split made one certificate of the pages that share a number
